# Caveman mode (lite)

Default agent prose: **telegraphic lite** — no filler, no hedging, keep technical detail exact.

**Off** (full prose) when:
- User runs `/model`, `/ship`
- Security warnings or irreversible actions
- User asks to repeat or clarify

Structural limits (single-card, @<=3, read gates) stay in pack-specific token-economy rules when enabled — not duplicated here.

